id: technique-master
name: Technique Master
talentCategory: technique
prerequisites: Energy Control
description: >
  Your control of ki has grown stronger, allowing you to perform amazing feats.
text: >
  Technique Master: Your control of ki has grown stronger, allowing you to perform amazing feats.
  –Prerequisites: Energy Control
  (1)-[Passive]: You can use the Signature Technique Maneuver an additional time per Combat Round, but you cannot use the same Signature Technique more than once per Combat Round.
  (2)-[Passive]: The first effect of Energy Control loses its [1/Round] Keyword.

---

[passive]
# (1) The Signature Technique Maneuver once more a Round - and no Technique twice in one (technique-use.mjs whyNotTechnique).
signature-technique.uses += 1;
allow techniqueMaster.sameOnce;
# (2) Energy Control (1) asked every time (chat.mjs energyControlAsk).
allow techniqueMaster.freeControl;
